{
  "name": "Weylus",
  "description": "A cross-platform high-performance remote input and screen mirroring system that transforms mobile devices into low-latency graphic tablets. It leverages OS-native input synthesis, such as the Linux uinput kernel interface, and hardware-accelerated video pipelines including VAAPI, NVENC, and VideoToolbox. The system provides high-fidelity stylus and multi-touch capabilities via a browser-based client and a specialized WebSocket control protocol.",
